HHIISSTTOORRYY
       Before  Netpbm  10.79 (June 2017), there was a different program by the
       same name in Netpbm, which was written by by Paul  Haeberli  <_p_a_u_l_@_m_a_n_‐
       _r_a_y_._s_g_i_._c_o_m> in 1989 and then modified extensively by others.

       Akira Urushibata <afu@wta.att.ne.jp> wrote the current version, with an
       entirely different algorithm, in April 2017 and contributed his work to
       the public domain.

       The current program is backward compatible with the pre-10.79 version.

